                  "name": "Voiced rationale paragraph",
                  "fill": "#CFE0D6",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Most dictation tools ask you to move into their interface. Voiced works from the editor already in focus, then gives longer captures a quiet place to wait. Nothing needs an account or a cloud transcript.",
