                      "fill": "$app-text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "I built these ideas into products because theory is forgiving and software is not. StoryLoops exposes proposed scope changes. Contexture turns the domain model into shared context. Voiced was small enough to test whether an agent-heavy build could still feel deliberate.",
