                      "fill": "$app-text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The agent can search, edit, run and report. I still want a person to own the product boundary, judge the evidence, and decide whether the change belongs. That is not a concession to current models. It is how the product keeps an author.",
